# Deployment secrets for DocuMind. This file is gitignored. Paste each value after the "=".
#
# 1) VERCEL_TOKEN
#    Sign up/in at https://vercel.com (use "Continue with GitHub"),
#    then open https://vercel.com/account/settings/tokens -> "Create Token"
#    (name: documind, scope: your personal account, expiration: 30 days is fine).
VERCEL_TOKEN=
#
# 2) HF_TOKEN
#    Sign up/in at https://huggingface.co (GitHub login works),
#    then https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens -> "Create new token"
#    -> Token type: "Write" -> name: documind -> Create.
HF_TOKEN=
#
# 3) NEON_DATABASE_URL
#    Sign up/in at https://neon.tech (GitHub login works) -> "Create project"
#    (name: documind, Postgres 16/17, region close to you: e.g. AWS Asia Pacific (Singapore) or US East).
#    On the project dashboard click "Connect" -> copy the connection string.
#    It looks like: postgresql://user:password@ep-xxxx.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb?sslmode=require
NEON_DATABASE_URL=
